on succeeded. Direct high transit reached the sink, but the palm contacted the spout and the carton slipped during lowering; official result=false. Stopping with the gripper still near the carton omitted a completion condition.","applicability":"This scene has a faucet above the destination; hand-only target reachability did not establish whole-arm clearance.","evidence":["Palm-spout contact recorded at observations14\u201316.","Finger gap collapsed from43.8mm after lift to2.15mm at observation18.","Official CounterToSink requires the object in the sink and gripper far away."],"next_attempt":"Plan clearance for the full arm and carry geometry; when unloading occurs at the intended release point, open and withdraw before official evaluation.","skill_steps":[]},"review_status":"reviewed against official result, actual RGB, public receipts and post-run contact diagnostics"},{"source_run":"PickPlaceCounterToSink-front","task":"PickPlaceCounterToSink","seed":7,"official_success":true,"observed_stop":"success","reflection":{"lesson":"Official task success=true after the carton slipped into the sink. The robot-facing transit avoided the earlier high palm collision, but link7 contacted the spout during inward lowering. No intentional release or withdrawal executed, so this is a successful task outcome with an uncontrolled drop, not a controlled-placement donor.","applicability":"One fixed-scene trial only; route is a development hypothesis, not a validated reusable placement skill.","evidence":["Official simulator terminal status=success after470 actions.","Link7-spout contacts at observations16\u201317; empty finger gap2.09mm in lower_place.","Loss occurred about16cm from the release goal, so the new3cm near-release completion branch did not execute."],"next_attempt":"Add full-arm collision-aware approach and controlled release, then repeat the policy on the same scene and test unseen scenes.","skill_steps":[]},"skill_status":"not_promoted: official task success without de